sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-035> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-035-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-035-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Ch. XV Fig. 328 — sea-urchin test meridian under envelope pressure/tension (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 74.9/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 adds multi-specimen segmentation, closure parameter sweep, sphere ablation (2.35× worse RMSE), literature ratio table, KS statistic, and documents Dryad mismatch in result.json (verdict mixed on broad claim; urchin instance partially supported). Overall 74.9/100 (faithfulness 71.6, reproducibility 82.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit pending; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.x, matplotlib 3.x, scikit-image 0.26.x, Pillow 10+. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 84, Morphological realism / specimen match 62, Parameter expressivity 76, Morphometric validation 68, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_035_on_the_shapes_of_eggs_and_of_c_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-035_on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-certain-other-hollo.py at pending, image/png, 72693 B, 1400×448 px, artifact_sha256 aea4edf7c5638ffd487bfa4fa620d277b8574bf7eca180fe169822001ea3573e (sha256 aea4edf7c5638ffd487bfa4fa620d277b8574bf7eca180fe169822001ea3573e), spec_fingerprint ca5163818e7027ab5d5283054726515355f4bff70768bf5884955d5df1ad41e0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: ca5163818e7027ab5d5283054726515355f4bff70768bf5884955d5df1ad41e0; artifact_sha256: aea4edf7c5638ffd487bfa4fa620d277b8574bf7eca180fe169822001ea3573e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-035/commons_sea_urchin_test_structure_8340336761.jpg=6d2cfb0d5593a906..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-035/commons_sea_urchin_tests_7_77.jpg=cf443a13714d2c93..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-035/echinoid_test_literature_ratios.csv=d6435dd20cf9e3f4..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-035/t1917_035_on_the_shapes_of_eggs_and_of_c_reference.json=76a472cb9dc861b4...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-31-t1917-035-on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-c-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson 1917: hollow structures including sea-urchin tests (Fig. 328) explicable as membranes/shells under pressure and tension. | Envelope equation p_n + T(1/r + 1/r') = P (p. 658).; reconstructed_in_script: Major-axis CV meridian; symmetric-pole Preston fit; Thompson 4-constraint closure; 2H profile; closure sweep GIF. | 14-test panel elongation dispersion; sphere ablation; KS vs literature axial:equatorial ratios.; transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric approximation of pentamerous urchin test; calcareous ossicle microstructure not modelled. | Dryad dn160 excluded (DATASET_MISMATCH); skulls/shells in claim not tested.; does_not_claim: That genetics dataset dn160 supports the claim. | Dynamic growth of the test — static meridian fit only.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.749"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Pass 2 assessor, loop thompson1917-t1917-035)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

